---
import AdminLayout from '../../layouts/AdminLayout.astro';
---

<AdminLayout title="文章工作区" description="DSI Admin 本机 Obsidian 文章管理、隔离准备、精确提交与发布。">
	<a class="admin-skip-link" href="#admin-main">跳到文章工作区</a>
	<main class="admin-page workspace-page" id="admin-main" data-workspace-page data-development={import.meta.env.DEV}>
		<header class="admin-intro">
			<p class="admin-context">DSI Admin</p>
			<div class="admin-intro-copy">
				<h1>文章工作区</h1>
				<p>正文来自 Obsidian。元数据与草稿保存在本机；准备和检查使用隔离工作区，确认提交后才写入博客仓库。</p>
			</div>
		</header>

		<div class="workspace-connection-bar">
			<p class="workspace-connection" role="status" data-workspace-connection>正在检查本地工作区…</p>
			<div class="workspace-actions">
				<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-reconnect hidden>重新连接</button>
				<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-refresh data-workspace-local disabled>同步源文件</button>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-workspace-notice></p>
		<section class="workspace-unavailable" aria-labelledby="workspace-unavailable-title" data-workspace-unavailable hidden>
			<h2 id="workspace-unavailable-title">本地工作区不可用</h2>
			<p data-workspace-unavailable-message></p>
		</section>

		<details class="workspace-configuration workspace-section" data-workspace-section="configuration" data-workspace-configuration hidden>
			<summary><span data-workspace-configuration-summary>工作区配置</span><code data-workspace-configuration-path></code></summary>
			<p class="workspace-help">仓库、Obsidian 来源与程序数据目录必须分开。安装版可使用系统目录选择器；开发服务也可填写本机完整路径。</p>
			<form data-workspace-configuration-form>
				<fieldset class="admin-fieldset admin-form-grid" data-workspace-local-fields disabled>
					<legend class="admin-visually-hidden">工作区配置</legend>
					<div class="admin-field admin-field--wide">
						<label for="workspace-repo">博客仓库</label>
						<div class="workspace-path-picker">
							<input id="workspace-repo" type="text" required spellcheck="false" data-workspace-config-repo />
							<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-pick-directory="repoRoot" data-workspace-local data-workspace-native hidden disabled>选择仓库目录</button>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="admin-field admin-field--wide">
						<label for="workspace-source">Obsidian 来源根目录</label>
						<div class="workspace-path-picker">
							<input id="workspace-source" type="text" required spellcheck="false" data-workspace-config-source />
							<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-pick-directory="sourceRoot" data-workspace-local data-workspace-native hidden disabled>选择来源目录</button>
						</div>
						<small>选择笔记根目录，不是 picture 或“博客发布”目录。直接纳入写作目录的原文，无需另复制发布副本；新文件仍需确认。</small>
					</div>
					<div class="admin-field admin-field--wide">
						<label for="workspace-site">正式站 HTTPS 地址</label>
						<input id="workspace-site" type="url" pattern="https://.*" spellcheck="false" data-workspace-config-site />
						<small>用于按本次 commit 确认正式站内容索引；留空时无法确认站点上线。</small>
					</div>
					<div class="admin-field">
						<label for="workspace-author">Git 提交作者</label>
						<input id="workspace-author" type="text" data-workspace-config-author />
						<small>留空使用仓库中已配置的 Git 身份。</small>
					</div>
					<div class="admin-field">
						<label for="workspace-email">Git 作者邮箱</label>
						<input id="workspace-email" type="email" data-workspace-config-email />
					</div>
				</fieldset>
				<div class="workspace-actions">
					<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="submit" data-workspace-configuration-save data-workspace-local disabled>保存工作区配置</button>
					<p class="workspace-help">任务进行中不能切换仓库或来源。</p>
				</div>
			</form>
			<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-tools></p>
			<form class="workspace-credential" data-workspace-credential-form data-workspace-native hidden>
				<div class="admin-field">
					<label for="workspace-credential">GitHub 凭据</label>
					<input id="workspace-credential" type="password" autocomplete="off" required aria-describedby="workspace-credential-help" data-workspace-credential />
					<small id="workspace-credential-help">仅交给桌面宿主，以 Windows 加密保存。不会写入浏览器存储，也不会回读到界面。</small>
				</div>
				<button class="workspace-button" type="submit" data-workspace-local disabled>加密保存凭据</button>
			</form>
		</details>
		<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-configuration-needed hidden>配置后可以读取仓库文章、选择原文并开始准备。</p>

		<div class="workspace-local-content" data-workspace-local-content hidden>
			<details class="workspace-intake workspace-section" data-workspace-section="intake" data-workspace-drop>
				<summary><h2 id="workspace-import-title">纳入笔记</h2><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-intake-summary></span></summary>
				<p class="workspace-help">整目录选择后可逐篇排除；目录路径形成专题层级。picture 只作为附件。桌面版可直接拖入 Markdown。</p>
				<div class="workspace-actions">
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-scan-directory data-workspace-local disabled>选择目录树</button>
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-import-single data-workspace-local disabled>纳入单篇笔记</button>
				</div>
				<ul class="workspace-messages" aria-label="纳入笔记错误" data-workspace-import-errors hidden></ul>
			</details>

			<details class="workspace-pending workspace-section" data-workspace-section="pending">
				<summary>新发现的笔记 <span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-pending-count>0</span> <span class="workspace-help">等待你确认，不会自动发布</span></summary>
				<p class="workspace-help">未选择的笔记保持待确认。“博客发布”历史副本不在此列；已有正式文章请先绑定原文，避免重复纳入。纳入只创建本地草稿并排队准备，不写正式仓库。</p>
				<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-pending-empty>没有待确认的新笔记。</p>
				<ul class="workspace-note-list" data-workspace-pending-list></ul>
				<div class="workspace-actions">
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-select-pending data-workspace-local disabled>全选新笔记</button>
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-clear-pending data-workspace-local disabled>清除选择</button>
					<span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-pending-selection-count>已选 0 篇</span>
					<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="button" data-workspace-import-pending data-workspace-local disabled>纳入所选新笔记</button>
				</div>
			</details>

			<div class="workspace-shell">
				<details class="workspace-library workspace-section" data-workspace-section="library" open>
					<summary><h2 id="workspace-library-title">文章管理</h2><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-article-count>尚未读取文章</span></summary>
					<div class="workspace-library-grid">
					<nav class="workspace-topics" aria-label="按专题筛选文章">
						<details class="workspace-section" data-workspace-section="topics" open>
						<summary><h3>专题层级</h3></summary>
						<p class="workspace-help">选择专题包含其全部后代文章。</p>
						<ul class="workspace-topic-tree" data-workspace-topics></ul>
						<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-edit-topic data-workspace-local disabled>编辑描述 / 置顶</button>
						<p class="workspace-help">先选择专题；父子描述分别保存，一级专题可设为文章页置顶。</p>
						<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-pinned-topic></p>
						</details>
					</nav>
					<div class="workspace-library-results">
					<div class="workspace-filters">
					<div class="admin-field">
						<label for="workspace-search">查找文章</label>
						<input id="workspace-search" type="search" data-workspace-search />
					</div>
					<div class="admin-field">
						<label for="workspace-filter">主状态</label>
						<select id="workspace-filter" data-workspace-filter>
							<option value="all">全部文章</option>
							<option value="uncommitted">未提交</option>
							<option value="committed">已提交 · 未推送</option>
							<option value="pushed">已推送</option>
						</select>
					</div>
					</div>
					<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-list-scope></p>
					<div class="workspace-actions">
						<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-select-page>选择本页</button>
						<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-clear-selection>清除全部选择</button>
						<span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-visible-selection></span>
					</div>
					<ul class="workspace-articles" data-workspace-articles></ul>
					<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-list-empty></p>
					<nav class="workspace-pagination" aria-label="文章分页">
						<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-page-previous>上一页</button>
						<span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-page-count></span>
						<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-page-next>下一页</button>
						<label class="workspace-page-size">每页 <select aria-label="每页文章数" data-workspace-page-size><option value="12">12 篇</option><option value="24">24 篇</option><option value="48">48 篇</option></select></label>
					</nav>
					<div class="workspace-selection">
						<div class="workspace-actions">
						<p class="workspace-count" data-workspace-selection-count>已选 0 篇</p>
						<p class="workspace-count" data-workspace-topic-draft-count>专题设置待提交 0 项</p>
						<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-prepare-selection data-workspace-local disabled>准备所选文章</button>
						<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="button" data-workspace-review-commit data-workspace-local disabled>查看精确差异并提交</button>
						</div>
						<p class="workspace-help">翻页与筛选保留选择。所选文章必须为未提交、当前版本准备就绪且输入已保存；专题描述和置顶可单独提交，所有已保存的专题设置草稿会加入差异。保存不等于提交或上线。</p>
					</div>
					</div>
					</div>
				</details>

				<details class="workspace-structure workspace-section" data-workspace-section="structure">
					<summary><h2>站点结构</h2><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-structure-summary></span></summary>
					<p class="workspace-help">按正式站专题层级与稳定目标文件名展示公开路由。修改标题或专题不会改文章路径。本机草稿、已提交、已推送均不代表已上线，上线结果以部署确认和正式站内容索引为准。</p>
					<p class="workspace-help">空专题列表表示未分类，是有效状态。空层级或非法字符请在文章信息中修正；缺失来源请重新绑定。目标文件名只读，重名目标需先整理工作区或使用唯一文件名重新纳入，改标题不能解决路径冲突。</p>
					<ul class="workspace-structure-issues" aria-label="站点结构诊断" data-workspace-structure-issues></ul>
					<ul class="workspace-structure-issues" aria-label="站点结构非阻塞提示" data-workspace-structure-notices></ul>
					<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-structure-empty>没有工作区文章可展示。</p>
					<ul class="workspace-structure-tree" data-workspace-structure></ul>
				</details>

				<div class="workspace-editor-column">
					<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-editor-empty>从上方文章管理中打开一篇文章，或先纳入 Obsidian 笔记。</p>
					<article class="workspace-editor" data-workspace-editor hidden>
						<header class="workspace-heading">
							<p class="admin-kicker">Current article / 当前文章</p>
							<h2 data-workspace-editor-title></h2>
							<div class="workspace-article-states">
								<span class="workspace-state" data-workspace-article-status></span>
								<span class="workspace-state" data-workspace-preparation-status></span>
								<span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-article-revision></span>
							</div>
							<div class="workspace-actions">
								<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-jump-editor>前往编辑字段</button>
								<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-jump-preview>前往正文预览</button>
								<a class="workspace-text-link" href="#workspace-library-title">返回文章管理</a>
							</div>
						</header>

						<details class="workspace-source workspace-section" data-workspace-section="source">
							<summary><h3 id="workspace-source-title">原文与目标</h3><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-source-summary></span></summary>
							<dl class="admin-file-ledger">
								<div><dt>Obsidian 原文</dt><dd><code data-workspace-source-path></code></dd></div>
								<div><dt>正式目标</dt><dd><code data-workspace-target-path></code></dd></div>
								<div><dt>公开路由</dt><dd><code data-workspace-article-route></code><span class="workspace-help"> · 发布目标，不是上线确认</span></dd></div>
								<div><dt>媒体身份</dt><dd><code data-workspace-media-id></code></dd></div>
							</dl>
							<p class="workspace-error-text" data-workspace-source-warning hidden>原文已丢失。重新绑定有效来源后才能准备或提交。</p>
							<div class="workspace-actions">
								<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-bind-source data-workspace-local disabled>绑定 / 更换原文</button>
								<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-open-source data-workspace-local data-workspace-native hidden disabled>打开原文</button>
							</div>
						</details>

						<details class="workspace-metadata workspace-section" data-workspace-section="metadata" open>
							<summary><h3>文章信息</h3><span class="workspace-help" data-workspace-metadata-summary></span></summary>
							<form data-workspace-metadata-form>
							<p class="workspace-help">字段自动保存在程序数据目录，不回写 Obsidian。描述缺失时保持空白；正文仍由原文管理。</p>
							<fieldset class="admin-fieldset admin-form-grid" data-workspace-metadata-fields disabled>
								<legend class="admin-visually-hidden">文章元数据</legend>
								<div class="admin-field admin-field--wide">
									<label for="workspace-title">标题</label>
									<input id="workspace-title" type="text" data-workspace-field-title />
								</div>
								<div class="admin-field admin-field--wide">
									<label for="workspace-description">描述</label>
									<textarea id="workspace-description" rows="3" data-workspace-field-description></textarea>
								</div>
								<div class="admin-field">
									<label for="workspace-date">完成日期</label>
									<input id="workspace-date" type="date" data-workspace-field-date />
									<small>YYYY-MM-DD。来自 completion_date；缺失或无效时需填写有效日期。</small>
								</div>
								<div class="admin-field">
									<label for="workspace-topic">专题层级</label>
									<input id="workspace-topic" type="text" aria-describedby="workspace-topic-help" data-workspace-field-topic />
									<small id="workspace-topic-help">用 / 分隔层级，例如“自然 / 生态实习”。留空表示未分类。</small>
								</div>
								<div class="admin-field admin-field--wide">
									<span class="admin-field-label">起止时间</span>
									<p class="admin-field-value" data-workspace-range-value></p>
									<small>来自源笔记的 start_date / end_date（只读，Admin 不改写原文）；用于文章页的起止时间展示。</small>
								</div>
							</fieldset>
							<div class="workspace-actions">
								<p class="workspace-help" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-workspace-save-status></p>
							</div>
							<section class="workspace-conflict" aria-labelledby="workspace-conflict-title" data-workspace-conflict hidden>
								<h3 id="workspace-conflict-title">工作区已出现新版本</h3>
								<p class="workspace-help">你的输入没有被覆盖。保留输入并保存会基于当前版本修改元数据，不修改最新正文。</p>
								<p data-workspace-conflict-current></p>
								<div class="workspace-actions">
									<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-conflict-reload data-workspace-local disabled>放弃输入，采用最新字段</button>
									<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-conflict-save data-workspace-local disabled>保留我的字段并重新保存</button>
								</div>
							</section>
						</form>
						</details>

						<details class="workspace-article-issues workspace-section" data-workspace-section="check">
							<summary><h3 id="workspace-issues-title">当前版本的检查结果</h3><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-check-summary></span></summary>
							<ul class="workspace-messages" data-workspace-article-errors hidden></ul>
							<ul class="workspace-messages workspace-messages--warning" data-workspace-article-warnings hidden></ul>
							<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-article-issues-empty></p>
							<details class="workspace-raw" data-workspace-section="article-technical"><summary>检查技术详情</summary><pre data-workspace-article-technical></pre></details>
						</details>

						<details class="workspace-preview workspace-section" data-workspace-section="preview" open>
							<summary><h3 id="workspace-preview-title">正文预览</h3><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-preview-summary>本地只读 · 非上线页面</span></summary>
								<p class="workspace-help">使用工作区返回的渲染结果并经 DOMPurify 清理。正式构建是否通过，以当前版本的准备结果为准。</p>
							<p class="workspace-error-text" role="status" data-workspace-preview-error hidden></p>
							<article class="article-shell workspace-preview-document">
								<header class="article-header">
									<nav class="article-topic-path" aria-label="预览文章专题路径" data-workspace-preview-topic></nav>
									<div class="article-heading">
										<div class="article-copy">
											<p class="admin-kicker">文章 · 本机预览</p>
											<h2 data-workspace-preview-title></h2>
											<p class="article-description" data-workspace-preview-description></p>
										</div>
										<div class="article-meta" aria-label="预览文章信息">
											<div class="meta-index-item"><span class="workspace-help">完成日期</span><time data-workspace-preview-date></time></div>
											<div class="meta-index-item" data-workspace-preview-range hidden><span class="workspace-help" data-workspace-preview-range-label>起止时间</span><div class="article-date-range"><time data-workspace-preview-start></time><span data-workspace-preview-range-dash hidden> — </span><time data-workspace-preview-end></time></div></div>
											<div class="meta-index-item"><span class="workspace-help">目录章节</span><strong data-workspace-preview-headings>0</strong></div>
										</div>
									</div>
								</header>
								<div class="article-grid" data-workspace-preview-grid>
									<details class="toc-card" data-workspace-section="preview-toc" data-workspace-preview-toc open hidden>
										<summary>文章目录 <span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-preview-toc-count></span></summary>
										<nav class="toc-panel" aria-label="预览文章目录"><ul data-workspace-preview-toc-links></ul></nav>
									</details>
									<div class="article-body"><div class="article-prose admin-preview-content" data-empty="true" data-workspace-preview></div></div>
								</div>
							</article>
							<details class="workspace-raw">
								<summary>查看原始正文（只读）</summary>
								<pre data-workspace-source-body></pre>
							</details>
						</details>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>

			<details class="workspace-publication workspace-section" data-workspace-section="publication">
				<summary><h2 id="workspace-publication-title">推送与上线</h2><span class="workspace-state" data-workspace-publication-state></span></summary>
					<p class="workspace-help">发布会推送所有已提交未推送的内容。确认窗口列出具体 commit；未提交草稿不加入推送。</p>
				<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-publication-message></p>
				<code class="workspace-publication-sha" data-workspace-publication-sha></code>
				<div class="workspace-actions">
					<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="button" data-workspace-review-publication data-workspace-local disabled>查看发布提交清单</button>
					<a class="workspace-text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-workspace-publication-link hidden>打开部署结果</a>
				</div>
			</details>

			<details class="workspace-jobs workspace-section" data-workspace-section="jobs" open>
				<summary><h2 id="workspace-jobs-title">进度与错误</h2><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-jobs-summary></span></summary>
					<p class="workspace-help">状态由工作区实时通知，不定时轮询。失败按篇隔离；恢复后不会自动重复提交或推送。</p>
				<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-jobs-empty>当前没有任务记录。</p>
				<ul class="workspace-job-list" data-workspace-jobs></ul>
				<details class="workspace-section workspace-job-history" data-workspace-section="job-history">
					<summary><h3>任务历史</h3><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-jobs-history-count></span></summary>
					<ul class="workspace-job-list" data-workspace-jobs-history></ul>
				</details>
			</details>
		</div>

		<dialog class="workspace-dialog" aria-labelledby="workspace-import-dialog-title" data-workspace-import-dialog>
			<header class="workspace-dialog-heading"><h2 id="workspace-import-dialog-title">纳入单篇笔记</h2><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-close-dialog>关闭</button></header>
			<form data-workspace-import-form>
				<div class="admin-field">
					<label for="workspace-import-path">Markdown 完整路径</label>
					<div class="workspace-path-picker"><input id="workspace-import-path" type="text" required spellcheck="false" data-workspace-import-path /><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-pick-markdown data-workspace-local data-workspace-native hidden disabled>选择 Markdown</button></div>
				</div>
				<p class="workspace-help">直接选择已授权来源内的原文，不必复制到“博客发布”。文件名或标题可能对应现有文章时，请从该文章面板核对并显式绑定，保留原地址。</p>
				<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" data-workspace-dialog-status></p>
				<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="submit" data-workspace-local disabled>确认纳入并准备</button>
			</form>
		</dialog>

		<dialog class="workspace-dialog" aria-labelledby="workspace-tree-dialog-title" data-workspace-tree-dialog>
			<header class="workspace-dialog-heading"><h2 id="workspace-tree-dialog-title">目录树选择</h2><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-close-dialog>关闭</button></header>
			<form data-workspace-scan-form>
				<div class="admin-field">
					<label for="workspace-scan-path">来源内的目录</label>
					<div class="workspace-path-picker"><input id="workspace-scan-path" type="text" required spellcheck="false" data-workspace-scan-path /><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-pick-scan-directory data-workspace-local data-workspace-native hidden disabled>选择目录</button></div>
				</div>
				<button class="workspace-button" type="submit" data-workspace-local disabled>读取目录树</button>
			</form>
			<p class="workspace-help">目录复选框选择所有后代笔记；取消单篇复选框即可排除。已纳入的文章继续自动同步，picture 和“博客发布”历史副本目录不出现在文章树中。</p>
			<code class="workspace-tree-root" data-workspace-tree-root></code>
			<div class="workspace-actions">
				<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-tree-expand>展开全部</button>
				<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-tree-collapse>收起全部</button>
			</div>
			<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-tree-empty hidden>该目录中没有可纳入的 Markdown 笔记。</p>
			<ul class="workspace-tree" data-workspace-tree></ul>
			<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" data-workspace-dialog-status></p>
			<footer class="workspace-actions"><span class="workspace-count" data-workspace-tree-selection-count>将纳入 0 篇新笔记</span><button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="button" data-workspace-confirm-tree data-workspace-local disabled>确认纳入所选笔记</button></footer>
		</dialog>

		<dialog class="workspace-dialog" aria-labelledby="workspace-bind-dialog-title" data-workspace-bind-dialog>
			<header class="workspace-dialog-heading"><h2 id="workspace-bind-dialog-title">绑定 Obsidian 原文</h2><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-close-dialog>关闭</button></header>
			<p data-workspace-binding-title></p>
			<form data-workspace-binding-form>
				<p class="workspace-help" role="status" data-workspace-binding-match-status></p>
				<div class="admin-field" data-workspace-binding-candidates-field hidden>
					<label for="workspace-binding-candidates">原文候选（相对于 Obsidian 来源根目录）</label>
					<select id="workspace-binding-candidates" data-workspace-binding-candidates></select>
				</div>
				<div class="admin-field"><label for="workspace-binding-path">Markdown 完整路径</label><div class="workspace-path-picker"><input id="workspace-binding-path" type="text" required spellcheck="false" data-workspace-binding-path /><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-pick-binding data-workspace-local data-workspace-native hidden disabled>选择原文</button></div></div>
				<p class="workspace-help">旧“博客发布”副本请改绑到实际写作目录的原文。先比较两份内容，确认保留哪份正文；绑定后读取所选原文，保留现有文章地址、媒体标识与站点技术字段，并使旧准备结果失效。原文与旧副本都不会被 Admin 改写。</p>
				<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" data-workspace-dialog-status></p>
				<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="submit" data-workspace-local disabled>确认绑定并重新准备</button>
			</form>
		</dialog>

		<dialog class="workspace-dialog workspace-dialog--wide" aria-labelledby="workspace-commit-dialog-title" data-workspace-commit-dialog>
			<header class="workspace-dialog-heading"><h2 id="workspace-commit-dialog-title">确认本地提交</h2><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-close-dialog>关闭</button></header>
			<p class="workspace-help">只提交下列精确文件闭包，不包含原图、笔记库或无关工作区文件。差异失效时必须重新读取。</p>
			<dl class="admin-file-ledger"><div><dt>当前 HEAD</dt><dd><code data-workspace-commit-head></code></dd></div><div><dt>所选文章</dt><dd data-workspace-commit-articles></dd></div><div><dt>专题设置</dt><dd data-workspace-commit-topics></dd></div><div><dt>变更文件</dt><dd data-workspace-commit-file-count></dd></div></dl>
			<p class="workspace-warning-text" data-workspace-commit-stale hidden>内容或准备结果已变化。当前差异不能提交，请重新读取并确认。</p>
			<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-reread-diffs data-workspace-local disabled>重新读取精确差异</button>
			<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-commit-no-files hidden>当前没有文件差异，无需创建空提交。</p>
			<div class="workspace-diffs" data-workspace-diffs></div>
			<form data-workspace-commit-form>
				<div class="admin-field"><label for="workspace-commit-message">本次提交信息</label><input id="workspace-commit-message" type="text" required data-workspace-commit-message /></div>
				<label class="workspace-confirmation"><input type="checkbox" data-workspace-commit-reviewed />我已核对上方全部文件及提交前后内容，只提交这些变更。</label>
				<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" data-workspace-dialog-status></p>
				<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="submit" data-workspace-confirm-commit data-workspace-local disabled>确认写入仓库并创建本地提交</button>
			</form>
		</dialog>

		<dialog class="workspace-dialog" aria-labelledby="workspace-topic-dialog-title" data-workspace-topic-dialog>
			<header class="workspace-dialog-heading"><h2 id="workspace-topic-dialog-title">编辑专题设置</h2><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-close-topic>保存并关闭</button></header>
			<p data-workspace-topic-path></p>
			<p class="workspace-help">描述用于专题页的介绍，留空可清除。这里只保存本地草稿；查看精确差异并确认提交后才写入仓库，不改专题名称、文章归属或路由。</p>
			<form data-workspace-topic-form>
				<fieldset class="admin-fieldset" data-workspace-local-fields>
					<div class="admin-field"><label for="workspace-topic-description">专题描述</label><textarea id="workspace-topic-description" rows="5" maxlength="10000" data-workspace-topic-description></textarea></div>
					<div data-workspace-topic-pin-field hidden>
						<label class="workspace-confirmation"><input type="checkbox" data-workspace-topic-pinned />将当前一级专题置顶到文章页</label>
						<p class="workspace-help">只能置顶一个；选中会替换原置顶。文章页最多展示两个专题，第二位按最新文章完成日期自动补位，不重复。取消置顶或置顶无文章时，自动展示最近专题。</p>
					</div>
				</fieldset>
				<p class="workspace-help" role="status" data-workspace-topic-save-status></p>
				<div data-workspace-topic-conflict hidden>
					<p class="workspace-error-text">专题设置版本已变化。本地草稿仍保留，不能覆盖；可先复制输入，再放弃全部专题设置草稿并重新读取仓库。</p>
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-reset-topics>放弃全部专题草稿，读取仓库</button>
				</div>
				<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" data-workspace-dialog-status></p>
				<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="submit" data-workspace-save-topic data-workspace-local disabled>保存本地专题草稿</button>
			</form>
		</dialog>

		<dialog class="workspace-dialog workspace-dialog--wide" aria-labelledby="workspace-publish-dialog-title" data-workspace-publish-dialog>
			<header class="workspace-dialog-heading"><h2 id="workspace-publish-dialog-title">确认发布提交清单</h2><button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-close-dialog>关闭</button></header>
			<dl class="admin-file-ledger"><div><dt>发布 HEAD</dt><dd><code data-workspace-publish-head></code></dd></div><div><dt>分支</dt><dd data-workspace-publish-branch></dd></div><div><dt>远端</dt><dd data-workspace-publish-remote></dd></div></dl>
			<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-publish-uncommitted></p>
			<p class="workspace-warning-text" data-workspace-publication-stale hidden>工作区状态已变化，请重新读取提交清单后确认。</p>
			<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-workspace-reread-publication data-workspace-local disabled>重新读取发布清单</button>
			<ul class="workspace-messages" data-workspace-publish-errors hidden></ul>
			<p class="workspace-help" data-workspace-publish-empty hidden>没有已提交未推送的 commit，当前无需推送。</p>
			<ol class="workspace-publication-commits" data-workspace-publish-commits></ol>
			<form data-workspace-publication-form>
				<label class="workspace-confirmation"><input type="checkbox" data-workspace-publication-reviewed />我确认推送上方全部 commit，不加入未提交草稿，并跟踪这个 HEAD 的部署结果。</label>
				<p class="workspace-notice" role="status" data-workspace-dialog-status></p>
				<button class="workspace-button workspace-button--primary" type="submit" data-workspace-confirm-publication data-workspace-local disabled>确认非强制推送并跟踪部署</button>
			</form>
		</dialog>

		<dialog class="workspace-lightbox" data-lightbox data-workspace-lightbox aria-labelledby="workspace-lightbox-title" aria-describedby="workspace-lightbox-help">
			<div class="workspace-lightbox-surface">
				<header class="workspace-lightbox-toolbar">
					<h2 id="workspace-lightbox-title">图片预览</h2><span data-lightbox-counter aria-live="polite"></span>
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-lightbox-reset><span data-lightbox-zoom>100%</span> 恢复</button>
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-lightbox-close aria-label="关闭图片预览">关闭</button>
				</header>
				<div class="workspace-lightbox-view">
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-lightbox-previous aria-label="上一张图片">上一张</button>
					<div class="workspace-lightbox-stage" data-lightbox-stage><img class="workspace-lightbox-image" data-lightbox-image alt="" draggable="false" hidden /><p class="workspace-lightbox-status" data-lightbox-status role="status"></p></div>
					<button class="workspace-button" type="button" data-lightbox-next aria-label="下一张图片">下一张</button>
				</div>
				<footer class="workspace-lightbox-footer"><p data-lightbox-caption></p><p class="workspace-help" id="workspace-lightbox-help">滚轮缩放 · 放大后拖动查看 · 双击恢复 · Esc 退出</p></footer>
			</div>
		</dialog>
	</main>
	<script>
		import { initializeWorkspace } from '../../admin/workspace';
		initializeWorkspace();
	</script>
</AdminLayout>
